b-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alan's Auto</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$85,000 or 199 Robux</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Speed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Speed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">59 studs/s</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sometime in June 2025 (a shift in terrain i think)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Freyliner Transporter</b> is a vehicle that can be purchased for $85,000 from <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_Auto\" title=\"Alan&#39;s Auto\">Alan's Auto</a>. It is currently the largest vehicle in Oaklands. It is also one of the slowest, however. It can alternatively be bought for 199 Robux via the terminal next to the central display case\n</p><p>There is also a <a href=\"/wiki/Freyliner_Transporter_Upgrade\" title=\"Freyliner Transporter Upgrade\">box upgrade</a> that you can purchase at <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_Auto\" title=\"Alan&#39;s Auto\">Alan's Auto</a> for $25,000.  This upgrade adds a box and a toggleable truck door. If the box upgrade is used, nothing can detach from the truck. The boxed and unboxed modes can also be switched between, but must be done so close to the vehicle spawner.\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Freyliner Transporter is similar to <a href=\"/wiki/OptimusVehicle\" title=\"OptimusVehicle\">OptimusVehicle</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901213239\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.037 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 66/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 59/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 50/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019546/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.284      1 Template:Vehicles\n100.00%   30.284      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4083-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901213239 a